WEBVTT

00:06:59.426 --> 00:07:01.648
However, you still don't really know

00:07:01.648 --> 00:07:03.392
if a vaccine is going to work

00:07:03.392 --> 00:07:04.731
until you roll your sleeves up

00:07:04.731 --> 00:07:06.946
and vaccinate and wait.

00:07:06.946 --> 00:07:09.648
It's a gambler's game even today.

00:07:09.648 --> 00:07:12.160
So, we had to do that gamble.

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:14.640
We obtained an influenza vaccine,

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:16.256
we applied it to our Nanopatches

00:07:16.256 --> 00:07:18.727
and we applied the Nanopatches to the skin,

00:07:18.727 --> 00:07:20.460
and we waited --

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:22.288
and this is in the live animal.

00:07:22.288 --> 00:07:24.139
We waited a month,

00:07:24.139 --> 00:07:25.951
and this is what we found out.

00:07:25.951 --> 00:07:28.276
This is a data slide showing the immune responses

00:07:28.276 --> 00:07:30.599
that we've generated with a Nanopatch